        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cowardly warrior, a gullible thief, a clumsy sorceress, and priestess who can't heal are off on an adventure! The monsters and villains of the magical world will tremble with fear... or with laughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the simple graphics of <strong>Heroines of Swords &amp; Spells 2</strong> is a big RPG with <u>50+ hours of gameplay</u>. and If you dare to lead this team of clumsy heroines, you can expect:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/8138a52bc8bfeb649bfcbbb4b701d38d.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Lots of different quests!</strong> Work for the Warrior's Guild, give sermons, protect trade caravans, and even rescue wild boars from crazy adventurers!  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/abee4c95c969a5a9b68b12b17a1d865d.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Explore a big map!</strong> Walk through the streets of three cities. Go into every crypt and cave you can find. Discover all the hidden secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/d8e367f4591f2e8922f8db2b941ab177.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Manage your family estate!</strong> Accept requests, invest in fixing and building up the place, make deals to earn money, and <span class=\"bb_strike\">don't</span> forget to pay your taxes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/e1e9d48814a2b9f613f8dcb34dfd2f41.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Less grinding, more rewards!</strong> There are no endless waves of enemies, and all the dungeons are made by hand. Collect legendary items and equipment to make your team ready for anything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/62b980e043510c07133872982496dbe0.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, <strong>Heroines of Swords &amp; Spells 2</strong> has a <u>lot of reading</u>. There are <u>over 250,000 words</u> of story text in the game! The developer really went all out! He hopes you'll <strong>enjoy</strong> the world he's created and its funny characters.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > A cowardly warrior, a gullible thief, a clumsy sorceress, and priestess who can't heal are off on an adventure! The monsters and villains of the magical world will tremble with fear... or with laughter!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Behind the simple graphics of <strong>Heroines of Swords &amp; Spells 2</strong> is a big RPG with <u>50+ hours of gameplay</u>. and If you dare to lead this team of clumsy heroines, you can expect:<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/8138a52bc8bfeb649bfcbbb4b701d38d.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Lots of different quests!</strong> Work for the Warrior's Guild, give sermons, protect trade caravans, and even rescue wild boars from crazy adventurers!  <br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/abee4c95c969a5a9b68b12b17a1d865d.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><br>Explore a big map!</strong> Walk through the streets of three cities. Go into every crypt and cave you can find. Discover all the hidden secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/d8e367f4591f2e8922f8db2b941ab177.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Manage your family estate!</strong> Accept requests, invest in fixing and building up the place, make deals to earn money, and <span class=\"bb_strike\">don't</span> forget to pay your taxes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/e1e9d48814a2b9f613f8dcb34dfd2f41.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span><br><br><strong>Less grinding, more rewards!</strong> There are no endless waves of enemies, and all the dungeons are made by hand. Collect legendary items and equipment to make your team ready for anything.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3567620/extras/62b980e043510c07133872982496dbe0.avif?t=1780556608\" width=800 height=214 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally, <strong>Heroines of Swords &amp; Spells 2</strong> has a <u>lot of reading</u>. There are <u>over 250,000 words</u> of story text in the game! The developer really went all out! He hopes you'll <strong>enjoy</strong> the world he's created and its funny characters.</p>",
        "short_description": "A game for players who adore humorous fantasy adventures. A sprawling turn-based JRPG offering 50 hours of meticulously crafted plot, engaging quests, and no unnecessary grind. Four gorgeous yet utterly misguided heroines set out on perilous yet wildly entertaining adventures.",
